{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/317138-shadows-lurking-darkling","id":317138,"title":"Shadows lurking Darkling","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-20T02:15:17-08:00","id":317138,"title":"Shadows lurking Darkling","content":"My partner is making the PC for our Christmas themed <b>Changeling</b> game. He wants to remade his Asperger driven mortal in to Darkling lurking in shadows. As PCs Keeper is Arcadian Huntsman ( from the corebook ), we come to conclusion character would be his scout on the Wild Hunts, watching from darkness on the victims of the Horned God. <br /> <br /> I searched both corebook and <b>Winter Masques</b>, but I can't find proper Kith for this kind, &quot;stalker in the darkness&quot; iconic character for Darklings. Anyone could help with that?<br /> <br /> BTW: My partner want the PC to have a grasping tail - I so pose this kind of thing can be made with Kith's Blessing. So Dual Kith Merit to use this? And what Kith has this grasping extra limb to steal a power? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T07:59:13-08:00","id":317373,"title":"","content":"1. Skogsra is a more traditional forest Kith of Darkling, some animal communication. If you want something more feral it works. They are in Winter Masques, pg. 107. If you want to take sneaky to the next level, Lurkers work (from Victorian Lost) but while they improve Stealth they are more focused on Larceny (they are criminal types). I will note Whisperwips (Winter Masks, Kith section this time) make especially good spies, though they don't have anything specific you seem to be looking for.<br /> <br /> 2. No Kiths had extra limbs. I allowed a PC to take a 3 point merit that gives her a 1-2 die equipment bonus. In this case prehensile tongue, which adds to some Larceny and some Athletics checks, but not all of either...die bonus if any depends on circumstances. She has also used it in seduction. The player was a fan of the merit in the Sluagh book, though I disallowed it as something that can stun. Anyway, it has worked well and while it gives a small bonus it is characterful","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T11:03:13-08:00","id":317576,"title":"","content":"<i>Technically</i> there was a Keeper Mien feature that could be reinterpretted as a Kith that had extra arms in Autumn Nightmares, but that's a real stretch and a half.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-20T13:59:08-08:00","id":317690,"title":"","content":"I found the fan-made <b>Kith Compedium</b> and as I see it's hell lot of good work, I will let players to choose from it also. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> For example, I see this character could be Dappleskin from Beasts. Hushwarden from Darklings, or Shadowhaunt from Elementals. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/6ok0y6ad9edo13a/Kith%20Compendium.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/6ok0y6ad9edo13a/Kith%20Compendium.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/6ok0y6ad9edo13a/Kith%20Compendium.pdf?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/6ok0y6ad9edo13a/Kith%20Compendium.pdf?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}